<title>GERMANY: Vew says expect higher 1997 profit.</title>
<headline>Vew says expect higher 1997 profit.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>German energy group VEW AG said on Tuesday it expected a further improvement in earnings in the current year.</p>
<p>&quot;After a good start in the current business year we expect to raise profits against in 1997 given continued improvement in the economic environment,&quot; the company said in its annual report.</p>
<p>VEW said its net profit rose 12.5 percent in 1996 to 281 million marks on sales of 8.59 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
